    m_Localized: Start this stage over?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54563885379589
    m_Localized: 'Back to the title?

      Your current path will be lost.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54563885379590
    m_Localized: All Clear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54563885379591
    m_Localized: 'You cleared every stage!

      More stages are coming in future
      updates.

      You can replay the last stage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
